The AVX/FMA micro kernel ulmblas/level3/ukernel/avx/ugemm.tcc is derived
from the micro kernel bli_dgemm_haswell_asm_6x8 of BLIS (file
kernels/haswell/3/bli_gemm_haswell_asm_d6x8.c, BLIS 2.0) and is distributed
under the license of that file (provenance and modifications are listed in
ugemm.tcc):

